WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.920
This week, an incredibly damning new book

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.470
about President Trump came out

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:06.870
by renowned journalist Bob Woodward.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.440
And that's the third,

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:12.180
third negative Trump book
out this month alone.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.150
There are two others

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.470
from Trump's former attorney Michael Cohen

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.130
and Melania's former best friend.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:19.990
I cannot think of another president

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:22.450
who's had this many
negative books come out

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.610
while still in office.

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:26.700
Andy, do you have any of these books?

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.145
Actually Conan, I have all of them.

00:00:29.145 --> 00:00:33.300
And you can, too by joining
the Trump Book of the Day Club.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.330
Every day you'll receive a new book

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:37.410
about the President and his family

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:40.460
often written by someone
with deep inside knowledge

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.080
and always painting a devastating portrait

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:46.290
of an unfit lunatic let
loose in the White House.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.317
You'll get titles like these.

00:00:48.317 --> 00:00:50.180
"Oval Office, Square Colon:

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:52.667
The Medical Records of Donald Trump."

00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:56.877
"Destroyed! 600 Trump Jokes
that in the End, Did Nothing."

00:00:56.877 --> 00:00:59.940
"Imagine You're a Walrus and
Other Ways to Get Through Sex"

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:01.437
by Melania Trump.

00:01:01.437 --> 00:01:03.800
"Remember Me? No? That's Okay,

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:07.157
I Still Have a Lot of
Dirt on Trump" by Omarosa.

00:01:07.157 --> 00:01:09.990
"Not Proofread: Just Trying
to Shit This Book Out

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:13.387
Before the Electoin" by Carl Bernstein.

00:01:13.387 --> 00:01:16.177
"What a Douche" by Pope Francis.

00:01:16.177 --> 00:01:18.710
"A Lifetime of Unthinkable Abuse"

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:20.937
by Donald Trump's gold toilet.

00:01:20.937 --> 00:01:22.720
"I Went to High School with Ivanka.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:25.570
Not the Same Year, but I
Heard She was Kind of Mean"

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:27.017
by Jennifer Flack.

00:01:27.017 --> 00:01:30.266
"Becoming" by Melania
Trump with Michelle Obama.

00:01:30.266 --> 00:01:34.336
"Of Course I'm a Lunatic"
by Donald Trump's doctor.

00:01:34.336 --> 00:01:38.120
"Selt and Pooper: Melania's
Weird Mispronunciations

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:41.037
of Common Spices" by a White House chef.

00:01:41.037 --> 00:01:43.600
"He's a Terrible Person,
and That's Coming From Me,

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.257
the Literal Devil" by Stephen Bannon.

00:01:46.257 --> 00:01:48.700
"Wasn't Doing Much, Thought
I'd Write a Trump Book"

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:50.227
by Dean Cain.

00:01:50.227 --> 00:01:53.980
"7 Melanias" written by the
seven identical septuplets

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.967
who play Melania Trump.

00:01:55.967 --> 00:01:57.680
"I'll Make You a Star, Kid:

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.110
The Pep Talk I Gave to the Coronavirus"

00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:02.467
by President Donald J Trump.

00:02:02.467 --> 00:02:04.930
"How to Make a Rose Garden Racist Somehow"

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:07.317
by White House gardener Steve Gillis.

00:02:07.317 --> 00:02:09.760
"Girl, Interrupted" by Mike Pence.

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:13.290
And finally, "Mushroom
Penises Make Mushroom Clouds"

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.300
by Stormy Daniels.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:18.060
The Trump Book of the
Day Club, it never stops.

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:19.870
Never, even like when you think,

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.480
well, this is the one that
will totally sink the guy.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:25.720
Surely this is the last account
I'll see of his corruption,

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:28.310
cruelty, and total incompetence.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.780
No, there is no bottom.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:32.313
Happy reading, everyone!

